 "bedazzling-helm": "Infantry or cavalry only. Can be worn alongside other armour. Improves the wearer's armour value by 1, to a best of 2+, and enemy models attacking the wearer in the Melee Phase take -1 to their rolls To Hit. Its blinding gleam sends foes' strokes wide.",
