 "ironhide-talisman": "Infantry only. Enemy models that hit the bearer in the Fire Phase or Melee Phase must re-roll every natural 6 they roll To Wound. It has no effect against attacks that hit automatically. An old family heirloom said to turn its keeper's skin as hard as iron.",
 "talisman-of-protection": "Grants its bearer a 5+ Untouchable save. A modest charm wrapped in a strong warding aura.",
