 "obsidian-lodestone": "A model may buy up to three. One gives Magic Resistance (-1), two give Magic Resistance (-2) and three give Magic Resistance (-3). Extremely common. The black glass carries a chill that stills the Eight Threads around it.",
 "periapt-of-soul-exchange": "Single use. In the Command sub-phase of their own turn, the bearer may invoke it: D3 friendly models within their Command range are removed as casualties, and the bearer regains that many lost Hit Points. A thief's charm, paid for in other men's breath.",
