 "banner-of-the-steadfast": "Infantry only. If the unit carrying this banner is on the losing side of a combat, it may Fall Back in Good Order even when the winners' Unit Mass is more than double its own side's. Its stitched hero has held the same ford for three hundred years.",
 "totem-of-wrath": "In any turn it charged, the unit carrying this totem adds 1 to the Pierce of its weapons and may re-roll To Wound rolls of a natural 1. Those near it fight like starved hounds.",
