 "rod-of-might": "The bearer adds +1 to their casting results, but backlashes on a natural double 1 or double 2 on a Casting roll instead of only a double 1. Great power, and very little margin for a slip of the tongue.",
 "wand-of-jet": "The bearer adds +1 to their Casting and Dispel rolls. If they roll any natural double on either kind of roll, the wand shatters and is lost. The bonus changes the result only, so a natural double 1 still counts. Black stone, keen and fragile.",
 "staff-of-quietude": "In the Command sub-phase of their own turn, the bearer may take a Resolve test; if passed, every Remains in Play spell on the table is dispelled, friendly ones included. One sweep of the staff and the Eight Threads fall still.",
 "scroll-of-disruption": "Once per turn, the bearer may re-roll a Dispel roll, re-rolling every die, bonus and discard dice from rules or items included. Its words set the enemy's spells fraying.",
