 "infernal-familiar": "Its owner knows either Ruinbolt or Winds of the Dominion as well as their other spells. If they ever backlash while casting that spell, they may not cast it again this game, on top of the Backlash table result. A helpful voice at the shoulder, and never an honest one.",
